00:00:00.399 --> 00:00:03.590 align:start position:0%
 
good afternoon  my name is jesse benall and i'm counsel  to the trump campaign  donald trump won the state of nevada  after you account for the fraud and  irregularities  that occurred in the election this  afternoon  we have filed a contest of the election  in carson city district court and  we are asking the court to recognize the  fact  that president trump was victorious in  this election  i'm going to go ahead and hand it off to  matt schlapp  thank you jesse  today is an important day about trusting  free elections in america as we have  gone through this process since  election day we have been guided by  facts math and science  every american needs to trust  what happens when we vote and especially  the 73.3 million  americans who voted for the president  they deserve answers they need  transparency  and they need it right now  in all my years in politics  i have never seen the types of voter  irregularity  we have seen in clark county  the zeal to push reckless unsolicited  mail-in voting resulted in 50 percent  of ballots coming through the mail in a  ten-fold increase  in mail ballots in clark county  fact the voter lists were never  appropriately scrubbed including the  press reports  after foia requests of not  scrubbing over 80 000 primary voters  before the general election ballots  were made fact  illegal ballots never should have been  mailed  and they never should have ended up in  the final tally  how did this happen this happened  with a reckless change in nevada  election  rules right before the general election  which reduced the democratic norms  of meaningful observation by the media  and by americans the reduction of ballot  security  and almost the elimination of signature  verification  nevada and clark county have created  this crisis reckless  unsolicited mail-in voting  has created this crisis  there have been so many volunteers since  election day many of whom were here  today many more  could not make it because they continue  to work night and day  to expose the truth that's what we're  guided by  the truth be it something we want to  hear  or be it something we not want to hear  we don't like  discovering the historic level levels  of voter irregularity for all these  volunteers for all these lawyers  both in nevada and around the country  who have been attacked  who have been doxxed who have lost  professional opportunities  all for standing up for just  transparency of information from the  government  to her citizens we honor you  to the whistleblowers over a dozen here  in nevada and growing  and to the whistleblowers around the  country  we thank you we admire you  we stand with you we have talked with  you  about the threats that you fear you will  face  for simply trying to point out  the wrong doing and the illegality  that you observed and to my fellow  americans  i think we all know this and have this  in common  we would love to heal and to unite that  cannot happen  until the truth is revealed until the  facts  are known until people have answers  to their questions and adam laxalt is  going to walk through  those facts in this case  [Applause]  good afternoon everybody so  today is an important day for nevada  over the last 10 days or so  the media has continued to ask for the  evidence  of the irregularities that we found in  this election  in fact some media already concluded a  few days ago that there was no  fraud presented and  i need everyone to understand the  herculean task  that we face to try to from the outside  of a system  help shine a light on the irregularities  in this system we don't own the system  we aren't part of the system  there are no former fbi investigators  there's no former team of attorney  general  pi investigators these are people that  are volunteering these are people that  have given the last few weeks of their  lives  trying to run down the complaints we've  received  from across the state everyone  has some experience  in the last few weeks that leaves them  some  doubt about whether this election  was conducted freely and fairly a number  of you  in the media i spoke to off the record  that said people in your  in your uh newsrooms had extra ballots  mailed to their homes  or they felt that someone else had had  potentially cast the ballot  on their behalf these are stories that  poured in  and again we're trying to take an  imperfect  system and do our best to shine light  so it's an important day for nevada  because this  lawsuit is bigger than  whether the president won nevada or  former vice president joe biden won  nevada this lawsuit  is about taking this collected effort  this collected work  and presenting it in an election contest  and let me just say that  many people started complaining in  august  when this system was fundamentally  transformed  the concerns of the radical  transformation of this election  were put in op-eds they were put in news  interviews  they were put anywhere people would  listen  and these concerns ended up  bearing true now what are the  what are the primary concerns of what we  face  we converted to this wide scale  mail-in balloting election  as was already recounted we had a lot of  improper  ballots being mailed to people's homes  and apartment buildings  and across the valley now  we were told that the much vaunted  signature verification process would  cure any potential  for someone to take a loose ballot  to fill out who who they would vote for  and sign the envelope and mail it back  in  what we are providing today in this  lawsuit is that  many of these votes  were improperly cast  we are presenting today in our formal  contest  that there are north of fifteen 000  people  who voted in nevada  and another state we are presenting  that people voted in people that had  already done a change of address and  left this state  outside of 30 the 30-day requirement  their ballots  were still cast we are also presenting  dead voters now  it's important for everyone to  understand  we don't get to pick up the phone and  call the registrar and say we  think we've found a dead voter will you  confirm or deny this is a dead voter  there's nothing in this process that  allows that  and i encourage you to ask joe gloria  as he said in press conferences there is  no  forward investigatory process  in the clark county voting system there  is no one right now  in this system that is combing through  voter rolls  and is looking for dead people that may  have voted in this election i hope  everybody understands that i hope  everyone  accepts that as fact they are a  complaint based system so an individual  has to  complain that they think something  happened and then even then joe gloria  says  those complaints are forwarded to the  secretary of state's office  so i will only leave one example  if a person has died and that ballot  was mailed to someone's home and someone  voted that  that ballot who is going to complain  about that vote cast  no one quite clearly so the system  isn't investigating these things and so  we've brought forward these classes of  voters  now what are the other class of voters  that we think  make up the number that that puts this  presidential election in jeopardy  the mail-in ballot system which in clark  county was  upwards of 500 000 votes  started with a machine  this machine was the first  pass for signature verification  okay now we've spoken to experts  and this is part of our lawsuit we've  spoken to many  what they call ai experts and computer  vision  experts and what you will find  is that this machine doesn't have some  large professional body  an election integrity body that has  certified  this machine to be used to verify  signatures  okay you will also find  that in clark county they took  the factory setting and they adjusted it  to 40 percent of a signature match  now what these people will say is  once clark county took that factory  setting  and they manually adjusted it  it makes the results  of the signature match unverified  and something that cannot be relied upon  they will also say and this came out in  one of our hearings  the clark county elections admitted in  hearing that the factory setting for  this machine  wants a particular quality of photo  image  to match and so any of you  that signed your ballot and sent it  through this machine  your signature is this high quality  photo image now what they said in court  is that the signature that they're using  to match  came from the nevada system and that  signature that photo quality was  well below the 200. so we have two  different  reasons why the matches of  north of 100 between 130 to 200  000 signatures that were verified with  this machine  are not reliable these are the classes  that we are presenting to this court  these are the classes that we believe  are in jeopardy for this particular  election and next i want to turn to  jesse to go over  at least a few other irregularities that  are in the lawsuit  thank you adam of course meaningful  observation  is key to any free election system  worldwide being able to have observers  watch the whole process is something  that goes to the heart  of any democratic republic we didn't  have that  through too much of this election  process it was done in the shadows in  the dark  also provisional ballots were handled  irregularly and different voters  were treated differently depending on  what polling location they went to  and when they went there giving some  people the right to vote  and taking that right from others  you had unfortunate situations where  there was schemes set up  to give voters something of value  raffle tickets t-shirts other things  like that if they would come  and vote something that violates federal  law  something that violates nevada law  what's worse  and that you don't even have to prove  this to show that it's unlawful  is that same campaign that paid people  to vote were encouraging people to come  out and vote  for the biden harris ticket  you had a lack of security in too many  of the systems for voting  making it far too susceptible to bad  actors  and the bad actors came  the fraud came we have  we have one eyewitness one whistleblower  who actually saw people filling out  ballots at buying a biden harris fan  this fraud these irregularities  cannot stand in a free society  it takes in dilutes the votes  dilutes the rights of nevadans and  americans  who should all have an equal vote  and that's what this campaign is is  doing that's why we are here  we want every legal vote to count  we want full observation and  transparency and we want  to hold accountable now a system  that was right for fraud and allowed  that fraud to come  and that's why we're going to court  we'll be able to take a few  jesse you questions off the press  conference by saying that donald trump  warned about it  yes do you plan in this lawsuit to give  specific evidence  names addresses of some 35 000 voters  that need to be a margin that you would  need  to prove we are going to give evidence  in  and we have evidence of in  in various different forms  of uh of irregularities and fraud in  this process  that span that gulf between  vice president biden and president trump  to show  that the irregularities are such  that the the media's declaration that  joe biden  won nevada is wrong and president trump  was indeed the victor of nevada we have  declarations  yes we we have we have  declarations from  over 400 people just so far  nevadans that  go to the fact that these irregularities  and  and this fraud existed and we are going  to put on  evidence admissible in a court of law  and let a court see  what actually happened here  yes sir so this is a a state court  action because it's an election  in here it contest like you're making  some of the same arguments for me before  judge wilson  how do you plan to get her is this a  different case you're presenting  regarding me  or is it the same it's a different case  with different parties and different  issues  um and you know one of the one of the  issues that already was  was previously um uh considered by by  the court is is whether the plans in  that case for instance had standing  and so you know there there will be a  number of legal issues decided but we're  we're quite confident in the fact that  when the law and the facts are clearly  adjudicated in this matter that it will  be very clear  that once all the the voting happened  once once everything occurred the  results were  unreliable because of the irregularities  in the  i hear you fraud a couple of minutes ago  say voters were paid to vote for  brighton  specifically voters were given something  of value to vote  a raffle ticket uh items of clothing  the raffle tickets were for cash cards  and that's something that's clearly  against the law to give someone  something of value to vote  and then on top of that the same  campaign  that was doing the raffles that was uh  you know giving giving people shirts and  cash cards and everything else like that  also said uh you know to  encourage people wearing biden harris  paraphernalia  encourage them to come out and vote  for but for the biden harris ticket  uh it's a campaign that's that's fully  um explained  in in the lawsuit um it it happened all  over the country but  and we can get you more details  specifically on that  think i think we can take one more and  then we'll be available later for any  specific questions  in the process of trying to get this  information from voters and how are they  identifying themselves  we are using and we have put thousands  of man-hours in this  at this point as mr laxalt has already  explained  having volunteers and  and workers go out and verify the data  that we've been able to  to collect and we're going to do  everything we can in a very short amount  of time  and so far it's been without any  investigative powers you know is that  none of the investigative 